---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms of use" description="Terms for using SECOND / PASS.">
  <section class="shell route">
    <header class="route-head">
      <div class="kicker">/ TERMS</div>
      <h1>Terms of use.</h1>
    </header>
    <div style="max-width:var(--reading);font:1.18rem/1.65 var(--reader)">
      <p><strong>Effective:</strong> August 10, 2026. <strong>Last updated:</strong> August 10, 2026.</p>

      <h2>Site and publication use</h2>
      <p>Content on SECOND / PASS is for general informational and research purposes. It is written for engineers, technical leaders, and people making infrastructure decisions. It is not professional advice.</p>

      <h2>Technical research and models</h2>
      <p>Articles, calculations, and data products depend on stated assumptions, input parameters, and the data available at the time of publication. Models and calculations must be independently verified before being relied upon for commercial, engineering, or security decisions. Scenario outputs are not universal claims.</p>

      <h2>No professional advice</h2>
      <p>Nothing on this site constitutes engineering, legal, financial, or security advice. Decisions based on or influenced by this content are your responsibility.</p>

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>Original writing, figures, research design, data organization, and visual design are the work of SECOND / PASS. You may reference and quote published material for personal or internal use with attribution. Third-party names, trademarks, and product names remain the property of their owners.</p>

      <h2>Downloads</h2>
      <p>CSV and XLSX files are provided with their assumptions, sources, and methods documented. They are not guaranteed to be fit for any particular purpose. Verify data against primary sources before use.</p>

      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>Links to third-party sites are provided for reference. Third-party content and availability are controlled by their respective operators.</p>

      <h2>Commercial services</h2>
      <p>Research engagements and intelligence work are governed by separate scope-of-work agreements and terms. Submitting an inquiry through this site does not create a contractual relationship.</p>

      <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>Do not use forms or services to submit spam, fabricated information, or abusive content. Honeypot and same-origin validation are in place; circumventing these is not permitted.</p>

      <h2>Warranty and liability</h2>
      <p>Content is provided as-is. While we aim for accuracy and correct errors promptly, we make no warranty as to completeness, currency, or freedom from error. Use of this site is at your own risk.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>These terms may be updated. The effective and last-updated dates will reflect any changes. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance.</p>

      <p class="legal-blocker"><strong>LEGAL CONTACT BLOCKER — VERIFIED PRIVACY CONTACT REQUIRED</strong></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  h2 {
    font: 600 1.05rem/1.3 var(--sans);
    letter-spacing: -.01em;
    margin-top: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .legal-blocker {
    margin-top: 32px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    font: .88rem/1.4 var(--mono);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
</style>
